  "clf_control": {
   "text": "**Title: \"Echoes of the Road\"**  \n\n*(Verse 1)*  \nI walked the streets where the wind used to sing,  \nA melody that never quite left my mind.  \nThe laughter of the crowd, the silence in the night,  \nA rhythm that I can’t forget.  \n\n*(Pre-Chorus)*  \nI remember the days we used to ride,  \nThrough the town where the sun never quite lied.  \nThe stories we told, the dreams we chased,  \nNow they’re just echoes in my heart.  \n\n*(Chorus)*  \nEchoes of the road, they call me back,  \nA song that’s been lost, but I’ll never let it fall.  \nI’ll chase the sound, I’ll find the way,  \nThrough the silence and the noise, I’ll never stay.  \n\n*(Verse 2)*  \nThe old songs that used to fill the air,  \nNow just whisper through the cracks in the wall.  \nI’ve seen the world from different sides,  \nBut the heart still beats to the same beat.  \n\n*(Pre-Chorus)*  \nI remember the nights we used to share,  \nThe fire in the kitchen, the stars above.  \nThe love that we once held so close,  \nNow it’s just a memory I can’t lose.  \n\n*(Chorus)*  \nEchoes of the road, they call me back,  \nA song that’s been lost, but I’ll never let it fall.  \nI’ll chase the sound, I’ll find the way,  \nThrough the silence and the noise, I’ll never stay.  \n\n*(Bridge)*  \nI’ll walk the path where the shadows play,  \nAnd find the truth that’s been buried in the clay.  \nThe world is vast, but I’ll never be alone,  \nI’ll sing the song that’s been waiting for me.  \n\n*(Outro)*  \nEchoes of the road, they call me back,  \nA song that’s been lost, but I’ll never let it fall.  \nI’ll chase the sound, I’ll find the way,  \nThrough the silence and the noise, I’ll never stay.",
